@startuml
!include theme.iuml
title Desktop attachment and truthful entry saving
hide footbox
autonumber
actor Contributor
participant "app : App" as App
participant "audio_utils\n<<module>>" as Audio
participant "dataset\n<<module>>" as Dataset

activate Contributor
opt Explicit attachment, with no unfinished recording
  Contributor -> App : attach_audio_file()
  activate App
  note over App : A cancelled chooser leaves the draft unchanged.
  opt File selected
    App -> Audio : attach_file(source, AUDIO_DIR)
    activate Audio
    note over Audio : Copy to a sibling temporary file;\natomically publish a generated filename.
    Audio --> App : Filename or AudioError
    deactivate Audio
    alt Copy succeeded
      App -> App : _stage_audio(filename, label)
      activate App
      note over App : Own the new draft file; invalidate approval.\nRemove only older draft-owned files;\nreport cleanup errors and retain ownership for retry.
      App --> App : New attachment staged
      deactivate App
    else Copy failed
      note over App : Report error; retain previous attachment and text.
    end
  end
  App --> Contributor : Attachment or actionable feedback
  deactivate App
end
Contributor -> App : save_entry()
activate App
alt Recording / stop / captured-audio save unfinished
  note over App : Refuse save; retry/finish audio or discard deliberately.
else Blank trimmed expression
  note over App : Show Missing text; retain draft.
else Valid ready draft
  note over App : Generate ID/time; use current fields.\nApproval requires an exact reviewed snapshot.
  App -> Dataset : append_entry(entry)
  activate Dataset
  note over Dataset : Locked read-modify-write and atomic replacement;\nexpanded in the storage sequence.
  Dataset --> App : Committed or storage exception
  deactivate Dataset
  alt Write failed
    note over App : Show Save failed; preserve draft and audio.
  else Write committed
    note over App : Remove committed filename from draft ownership.\nReset fields, retain contributor; report Saved.
    App -> App : _release_audio(); _discard_staged_audio()
    activate App
    App --> App : Cleanup outcome; errors reported separately
    deactivate App
    App -> Dataset : load_all() through _refresh_views()
    activate Dataset
    Dataset --> App : One shared snapshot or read error
    deactivate Dataset
    note over App : Update count/recent/browse/Stats from that snapshot.\nA refresh failure preserves views; it does not undo the commit.
  end
end
App --> Contributor : Saved status or retained draft with error
deactivate App
deactivate Contributor
legend bottom
  Preserved desktop compatibility only; authenticated web saves never use this global CSV.
  Files are staged before row creation; CSV and audio are not one transaction.
  Committed audio survives draft clearing and row deletion.
  Dialog/widget and low-level I/O calls are condensed, not additional messages.
endlegend
@enduml
